NAME
    gcloud apihub host-project-registrations - manage Host Project Registration
        resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud apihub host-project-registrations COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Host Project Registration resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a Host Project Registration.

     describe
        Describe a Host Project Registration.

     list
        List Host Project Registrations.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha apihub host-project-registrations

